# Collection type: list.
#
# CQL lists are ordered collections of elements (e.g., list<text>).
# They support positional access, append, prepend, and removal.
# Lists are currently unsupported: the parser rejects the "list" type
# name, and list literal syntax ([...]) is not recognized by the lexer.
# These tests document the expected errors.

exec
USE defaultdb
----

